; An invalid --forecast-while predicate in a balance report is still
; reported when the report's chain no longer evaluates it for real
; postings: forecast_posts evaluates it on the first forecast group.
; The error is raised in forecast_posts::flush, outside the per-posting
; "While handling posting" context, so a balance report's diagnostic no
; longer points at a journal line.  The register report still evaluates
; the predicate on each posting and keeps that line pointer.

2030/03/01 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

~ Monthly from 2030/06/01
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal --forecast-while Food --now 2030/06/15 -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  Food
  ^^^^
Error: Unknown identifier 'Food'
end test
